WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:03.467
-Well, we're back
from a two-week break,

00:00:03.467 --> 00:00:05.100
and I haven't checked in
on the news yet,

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.968
so let me just take a look
at these cue cards here.

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:09.067
Russia is reportedly on
the verge of invading Ukraine.

00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:10.300
Well, that's not good.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.000
Fox News and
the Republican Party

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.234
want to put Hillary Clinton
in jail

00:00:13.234 --> 00:00:14.501
for a made-up thing again.
Oh, boy.

00:00:14.501 --> 00:00:17.901
Mike Lindell wants to send
pillows to anti-vax truckers

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:19.067
in Canada.
Yikes!

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:21.901
And Donald Trump took classified
documents to Mar-A-Lago

00:00:21.901 --> 00:00:24.200
and flushed official White House
records down the toilet.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.133
Alright, well, anyone
could have predicted that part.

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:28.334
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:30.267
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:31.300
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.200
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.033
Let me tell you how hard it is
to be a talk show host.

00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:39.901
It's not.

00:00:39.901 --> 00:00:42.167
But there are still
some rough moments, okay?

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:43.367
For example, two weeks ago,

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:44.667
we went on break
for the Olympics,

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:47.567
and then a few hours
after we taped our last show,

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:49.133
I'm at home, minding
my own business,

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.667
when I see this headline.

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:54.767
"'Masked Singer' judges walk out
after Rudy Giuliani reveal."

00:00:54.767 --> 00:00:57.868
And I didn't have a show
to talk about that!

00:00:57.868 --> 00:00:58.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:00.467
I couldn't talk to my kids
about it,

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:02.200
because, long story short,
they're Trump supporters.

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.801
I don't want to get into it.

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.467
I don't want to get into it.
They're doing it to punish me.

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:07.067
I don't think they actually
believe it.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.234
Point is, I needed my show.

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:11.934
So I called the president
of NBC and said,

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:13.200
"Did you hear
about this Rudy news?"

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.100
And he said, "How did you
get this number?"

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.934
And then I said, "Can you
cancel the Olympics?"

00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:19.133
And he said no, and I said,

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:20.734
"But Rudy was on
'The Masked Singer.'"

00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:22.767
And he said, "Seth,
do you really think

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:25.734
this is the last crazy thing
Rudy Giuliani is ever gonna do?"

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:28.067
And I said no.

00:01:28.067 --> 00:01:29.701
And he said, "Okay,
don't ever call me again."

00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:31.033
But I did find a solution.

00:01:31.033 --> 00:01:32.300
I took my desk to Central Park,

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.167
and I did a monologue
in the middle of the night

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:36.067
for all the joggers
and squirrels.

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:37.133
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:39.100
I even tried posting
a bunch of jokes

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:42.100
on Donald Trump's new Twitter
rip-off called Truth Social,

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.667
which apparently
went live last night.

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:45.968
But like lots of people,
I couldn't even log in,

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:47.367
because when it launched,

00:01:47.367 --> 00:01:49.400
select users who tried
to create accounts

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.467
were repeatedly met
with a red error warning --

00:01:51.467 --> 00:01:54.000
"Something went wrong.
Please try again."

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.133
Though, by the time you find
yourself signing up

00:01:56.133 --> 00:01:58.100
for Donald Trump's
social-media site,

00:01:58.100 --> 00:01:59.934
something already went wrong.

00:01:59.934 --> 00:02:01.467
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.467 --> 00:02:02.834
But I'm guessing
they'll try again.

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:05.501
If you were first in line
to sign up for Truth Social,

00:02:05.501 --> 00:02:07.334
you probably got some
free time on your hands.

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.767
"Well, I'm just sitting here
waiting for JFK Jr.

00:02:09.767 --> 00:02:11.467
to reappear at the Meadowlands
with Elvis

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:14.467
and the Loch Ness monster to
prove the election was stolen.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.200
I guess I'll try
logging in again."

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.534 --> 00:02:20.000
I really enjoy how vague
the error message is.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.300
"Something went wrong,"

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.033
like even they don't know
what the problem is.

00:02:24.033 --> 00:02:26.033
Usually you get an error code
or something,

00:02:26.033 --> 00:02:28.467
but Trump's site just gives you
a shrug emoji that says,

00:02:28.467 --> 00:02:30.934
"What were you expecting?
This thing's a cluster [Bleep],"

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:34.000
which makes sense because
the guy in charge of the site

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.000
is former GOP Congressman
Devin Nunes.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.033
Remember him?

00:02:37.033 --> 00:02:38.667
The guy who always looks
like the valet

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:43.067
who forgot where your car was,
or what cars even were.

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:44.467
He said on Fox News
this weekend,

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:46.334
he was hoping the site
would be fully functional

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:47.501
by the end of next month.

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:49.801
- This week, we'll begin
to roll out people

00:02:49.801 --> 00:02:51.701
on the Apple App Store.

00:02:51.701 --> 00:02:54.367
That's gonna be awesome
because we're gonna get

00:02:54.367 --> 00:02:56.634
so many more people that are
gonna be on the platform.

00:02:56.634 --> 00:02:58.467
And then, look, our goal is --

00:02:58.467 --> 00:02:59.334
and I think
we're gonna hit it --

00:02:59.334 --> 00:03:01.133
I think, by the end of March,

00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:02.801
we're gonna be
fully operational,

00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:05.100
at least within
the United States.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.367
-By the end of March?

00:03:06.367 --> 00:03:08.267
This is the digital age.

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:10.067
Everything is measured
in nanoseconds,

00:03:10.067 --> 00:03:12.634
and you're moving at the speed
of Civil War letters home.

00:03:12.634 --> 00:03:13.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.801 --> 00:03:15.367
So, anyway, I was too late
for the Rudy news

00:03:15.367 --> 00:03:16.968
and I couldn't post
about it on Trump's site.

00:03:16.968 --> 00:03:18.434
But unfortunately, there are
plenty of other

00:03:18.434 --> 00:03:21.534
Trump-adjacent pro-coup weirdos
up to their usual weirdness.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:25.167
Just to give you an idea of how
insane the world is right now,

00:03:25.167 --> 00:03:28.067
here's a real headline
I came across the other day.

00:03:28.067 --> 00:03:31.901
"MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell
and '10,000 pillows'

00:03:31.901 --> 00:03:34.133
blocked from joining
Ottawa protest."

00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:36.434
So, Lindell wanted to show
his support for the convoy

00:03:36.434 --> 00:03:38.434
of anti-vax truckers
paralyzing Ottawa

00:03:38.434 --> 00:03:39.634
by sending them pillows,

00:03:39.634 --> 00:03:41.534
but he was blocked
by the Canadian government,

00:03:41.534 --> 00:03:44.367
which he explained
on far-right TV channel Newsmax,

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:47.033
from what to me
looks suspiciously

00:03:47.033 --> 00:03:48.667
like a fake private plane.

00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:50.701
-Tell me what happened
today at the border.

00:03:50.701 --> 00:03:53.067
Did you get the --
did you get the pillows in?

00:03:53.067 --> 00:03:56.667
-No, we've got a --
we got a new permit.

00:03:56.667 --> 00:03:59.300
We got a permit.
I've left there.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:00.868
I'm not up there now.

00:04:00.868 --> 00:04:04.434
I'm actually coming
from another state.

00:04:04.434 --> 00:04:06.767
I have to go to another state.
My trucker's there.

00:04:06.767 --> 00:04:10.000
He's gonna cross --
gonna try tomorrow morning.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.801
They made us get another permit,
a different -- another permit.

00:04:13.801 --> 00:04:16.100
I don't know.
Regulations, red tape.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:18.167
We're gonna try again
tomorrow morning,

00:04:18.167 --> 00:04:20.334
and we're gonna
head into Ottawa.

00:04:20.334 --> 00:04:22.400
-I can't believe we're living
in a time

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:25.501
with our very own
Wile E. Coyote.

00:04:25.501 --> 00:04:28.267
[As Lindell] we're gonna send
10,000 pillows to Ottawa,

00:04:28.267 --> 00:04:30.567
and then I'm gonna
tie myself to a rocket

00:04:30.567 --> 00:04:33.067
and shoot myself
across the border.

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:35.934
[Normal voice] Also, why are you
so vague about your location?

00:04:35.934 --> 00:04:39.567
"I'm coming from another state
to another state"?

00:04:39.567 --> 00:04:40.934
Are you a fugitive?

00:04:40.934 --> 00:04:44.434
Did you get put on the FBI's
"least wanted" list?

00:04:44.434 --> 00:04:46.534
And let's take a look
at that background again.

00:04:46.534 --> 00:04:47.701
I mean, that's got to be fake.

00:04:47.701 --> 00:04:50.734
It's like a Zoom background
or a TV set

00:04:50.734 --> 00:04:52.567
he has constructed
in his living room

00:04:52.567 --> 00:04:54.734
so he can make it look like
he's on a private plane,

00:04:54.734 --> 00:04:58.167
or it's a real private plane
that doesn't actually fly

00:04:58.167 --> 00:05:01.701
and he just has it parked on
the street outside his house.

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:03.501
And I will say, Lindell
looks less like a guy

00:05:03.501 --> 00:05:05.634
who sells pillows
and more like a guy

00:05:05.634 --> 00:05:07.200
who sells grounded
private planes

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.567
for the purposes of
impressing people on Zoom calls.

00:05:09.567 --> 00:05:11.400
[As Lindell] Hey, check out
my new product,

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:13.734
Hot Tub Slices!

00:05:13.734 --> 00:05:17.767
It comes with a champagne flute
and two professional models.

00:05:17.767 --> 00:05:20.234
[Normal voice] Hot Tub Slices.
We came back hot.

00:05:20.234 --> 00:05:22.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.067
Take two weeks off,
you let the brain rest,

00:05:24.067 --> 00:05:25.834
and you come back
with Hot Tub Slices.

00:05:25.834 --> 00:05:28.100
[ Laughter ]

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.801
So, things are tense
everywhere right now.

00:05:30.801 --> 00:05:33.868
As we speak, hundreds of
thousands of Russian troops

00:05:33.868 --> 00:05:35.300
are amassed
on the Ukrainian border

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.501
amid warnings of
an imminent invasion by Russia.

00:05:37.501 --> 00:05:39.300
Now, I'm
no foreign-policy expert,

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.534
but my personal opinion
is a war would be catastrophic

00:05:42.534 --> 00:05:44.167
and the world should do
everything in its power

00:05:44.167 --> 00:05:46.801
to prevent one, which is
why I'm glad world leaders

00:05:46.801 --> 00:05:49.067
keep insisting diplomacy
is still an option,

00:05:49.067 --> 00:05:52.400
including the possibility of a
summit between Biden and Putin.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:54.834
-Overnight, president Biden
agreed in principle

00:05:54.834 --> 00:05:57.067
to meet with the Russian
leader, Vladimir Putin.

00:05:57.067 --> 00:05:58.767
This was in response
to a proposal

00:05:58.767 --> 00:06:00.767
from the French President,
Emmanuel Macron.

00:06:00.767 --> 00:06:04.167
Unclear how real
of a possibility this is.

00:06:04.167 --> 00:06:06.367
The White House says, in theory,
the president would do it,

00:06:06.367 --> 00:06:10.334
but only if Putin holds off
on invading Ukraine.

00:06:10.334 --> 00:06:13.000
-Fine, go for it.
Anything to stop a war.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.100
Let Biden meet with Putin
and put him to sleep

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.934
with stories about
the mean streets of Scranton

00:06:16.934 --> 00:06:19.400
and the Acela schedule
for the Eastern seaboard.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:21.567
It's still better
than the summit Trump did

00:06:21.567 --> 00:06:24.667
where he screamed at reporters
about insane conspiracy theories

00:06:24.667 --> 00:06:26.968
and held up a soccer ball
he got from Putin

00:06:26.968 --> 00:06:31.200
like a kid on Christmas
who was expecting a PS5.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.501
"This isn't what I meant when
I said I wanted to play FIFA!"

00:06:34.501 --> 00:06:38.667
I mean, maybe Biden can give
the soccer ball back to Putin.

00:06:38.667 --> 00:06:39.868
[As Biden] "Sorry,
it's a little deflated.

00:06:39.868 --> 00:06:42.133
Trump sat on it.
He thought it was an egg

00:06:42.133 --> 00:06:44.367
and treated it like
a Horton situation."

00:06:44.367 --> 00:06:46.334
[Normal voice]
Obviously, world leaders

00:06:46.334 --> 00:06:47.534
must do everything possible

00:06:47.534 --> 00:06:49.234
to de-escalate
and pursue diplomacy.

00:06:49.234 --> 00:06:51.234
And yet some Republicans
and right-wing pundits

00:06:51.234 --> 00:06:52.501
have claimed the crisis

00:06:52.501 --> 00:06:55.801
is actually just a manufactured
distraction by Democrats

00:06:55.801 --> 00:06:58.400
to divert attention from,
among other things,

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:00.467
Hillary Clinton,
who has once again

00:07:00.467 --> 00:07:02.200
become an obsession for them
for reasons

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:04.300
that, unsurprisingly,
are total bull[bleep].

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:06.334
-Is it all just a ruse?

00:07:06.334 --> 00:07:09.167
The administration hitting
the panic button on Russia.

00:07:09.167 --> 00:07:12.400
I questioned whether or not
the whole thing was a ruse,

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:15.701
with Jake Sullivan coming out
so hysterical over the weekend,

00:07:15.701 --> 00:07:17.467
telling us to get out of Ukraine

00:07:17.467 --> 00:07:19.968
and that Russia
is gonna invade today.

00:07:19.968 --> 00:07:22.167
Obviously, in retrospect,

00:07:22.167 --> 00:07:24.367
he was trying to change
the conversation

00:07:24.367 --> 00:07:26.601
from Hillary Clinton
and her bad behavior --

00:07:26.601 --> 00:07:28.534
-Uh, Maria?
-And her dirty tricks

00:07:28.534 --> 00:07:29.801
against Donald Trump.
-Maria.

00:07:29.801 --> 00:07:32.701
-They were spying on Trump,
as a candidate

00:07:32.701 --> 00:07:34.501
and as the president
of the United States,

00:07:34.501 --> 00:07:35.567
from the White House?

00:07:35.567 --> 00:07:38.000
Why is this not the biggest
story of the year?

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:41.601
-This is the biggest scandal --
spying scandal -- ever.

00:07:41.601 --> 00:07:44.367
-What you're talking about
is further than Watergate.

00:07:44.367 --> 00:07:47.434
-I think this is far worse
than Watergate, quite frankly.

00:07:47.434 --> 00:07:53.434
-Hillary Clinton hired people
who hacked into Trump's home

00:07:53.434 --> 00:07:58.534
and office computers, before
and during his presidency,

00:07:58.534 --> 00:08:02.300
and planted evidence
that he colluded with Russia.

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:04.234
Yeah, you heard that right.

00:08:04.234 --> 00:08:06.667
-Yeah, we heard that right.

00:08:06.667 --> 00:08:08.467
You just said it wrong.

00:08:08.467 --> 00:08:10.400
Because none of it is true.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:13.501
Disentangling the web of lies
here is nearly impossible.

00:08:13.501 --> 00:08:16.534
Basically, Fox News inaccurately
described a claim

00:08:16.534 --> 00:08:17.834
that had been cherry-picked

00:08:17.834 --> 00:08:19.801
from a court filing
by a special counsel

00:08:19.801 --> 00:08:22.234
assigned by former
attorney general Bill Barr

00:08:22.234 --> 00:08:24.701
to investigate the origins
of the Russia investigation,

00:08:24.701 --> 00:08:26.901
and then they lied about
that filing to the point

00:08:26.901 --> 00:08:29.534
where the special counsel
himself, John Durham,

00:08:29.534 --> 00:08:32.200
distanced himself
from the Fox News freakout.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:35.234
If you ask them to explain
what was actually in the filing,

00:08:35.234 --> 00:08:36.501
they'd probably say...
-I don't know.

00:08:36.501 --> 00:08:38.400
Regulations, red tape.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:39.834
[ Laughter ]

00:08:39.834 --> 00:08:42.167
-But suffice it to say,
Hillary Clinton did not hack

00:08:42.167 --> 00:08:44.601
into Trump's campaign or
spy on Trump's White House,

00:08:44.601 --> 00:08:46.167
and she certainly
didn't plant evidence.

00:08:46.167 --> 00:08:48.300
For one thing, why would you
have to plant evidence on a guy

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:51.434
who screams evidence
into TV cameras all the time?

00:08:51.434 --> 00:08:53.968
That would be like the cops
planting a bag of cocaine

00:08:53.968 --> 00:08:55.934
at a meth lab.

00:08:55.934 --> 00:08:57.334
They're making it sound like
Hillary Clinton

00:08:57.334 --> 00:08:58.968
was in a van
outside Trump Tower,

00:08:58.968 --> 00:09:02.167
hacking into the mainframe
"Ocean's Eleven"-style.

00:09:02.167 --> 00:09:03.868
"I'm into the Trump mainframe!"

00:09:03.868 --> 00:09:07.033
The password was just 'password'
spelled wrong."

00:09:07.033 --> 00:09:08.901
[ Laughter ]
Also, you think Hillary Clinton

00:09:08.901 --> 00:09:10.434
was capable
of hacking Donald Trump

00:09:10.434 --> 00:09:11.701
and digitally spying on him?

00:09:11.701 --> 00:09:14.467
Do I need to remind you how bad
she was with technology?

00:09:14.467 --> 00:09:17.601
-I don't know
who created Pokémon Go.

00:09:17.601 --> 00:09:20.601
[ Laughter ]

00:09:20.601 --> 00:09:23.434
But I'm trying to figure out
how we get them

00:09:23.434 --> 00:09:26.367
to have Pokémon Go To the Polls.

00:09:26.367 --> 00:09:30.300
-Yeah, that person
hacked Trump's campaign

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.033
and planted evidence.

00:09:32.033 --> 00:09:34.000
Sounds like my mom
drunkenly asking me

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:35.934
how to use FaceTime
on my tablet.

00:09:35.934 --> 00:09:37.234
"So, it's called an iPad.

00:09:37.234 --> 00:09:38.734
Does that mean
you need an iPen?

00:09:38.734 --> 00:09:41.400
Do not take away
my gin and tonic!"

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.300
I mean, my God, it's been years,

00:09:43.300 --> 00:09:44.868
and they're still obsessed
with Hillary.

00:09:44.868 --> 00:09:47.601
I'm gonna tell you
what my therapist told me

00:09:47.601 --> 00:09:50.767
about the Rudy Giuliani
"Masked Singer" news.

00:09:50.767 --> 00:09:52.767
"Let it go."
[ Laughter ]

00:09:52.767 --> 00:09:55.501
And yet I just can't quit you,
you goofy bastard.

00:09:55.501 --> 00:09:57.100
[ Laughter ]
Of course, if anything,

00:09:57.100 --> 00:09:59.133
it was Trump who was
tampering with evidence.

00:09:59.133 --> 00:10:01.501
As we now know,
he reportedly had a habit

00:10:01.501 --> 00:10:03.801
of flushing papers
down White House toilets --

00:10:03.801 --> 00:10:05.300
so, you know,
Happy Presidents' Day --

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:08.200
and that some
of the White House --

00:10:08.200 --> 00:10:09.601
some of the White House
documents

00:10:09.601 --> 00:10:12.167
that Donald Trump improperly
took to his Mar-a-Lago residence

00:10:12.167 --> 00:10:13.734
were clearly marked
as classified,

00:10:13.734 --> 00:10:15.868
including documents
at the top-secret level.

00:10:15.868 --> 00:10:17.901
Trump probably let the guests
flip through them

00:10:17.901 --> 00:10:19.834
for an extra fee
when they booked their stays.

00:10:19.834 --> 00:10:22.367
"Okay, so the breakfast buffet
is 100 dollars extra.

00:10:22.367 --> 00:10:24.801
There's also a day pass
to the swimming pool

00:10:24.801 --> 00:10:26.200
and spa
that costs 200 dollars.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:27.434
And for 300 dollars,

00:10:27.434 --> 00:10:30.734
you can peruse a classified
Pentagon document

00:10:30.734 --> 00:10:33.100
that confirms
the existence of aliens

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:37.367
walking among us in the form
of Midwestern pillow salesmen."

00:10:37.367 --> 00:10:39.000
[ Laughter ]
"So, just the spa?

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.901
Okay, just the spa."

00:10:40.901 --> 00:10:43.634
The right keeps ginning up
manufactured outrages

00:10:43.634 --> 00:10:45.033
about their favorite targets

00:10:45.033 --> 00:10:47.000
because they don't have anything
serious to talk about.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.000
They're too busy
dismantling democracy,

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.801
sending pillows
to Canadian truckers,

00:10:50.801 --> 00:10:52.300
and going on
"The Masked Singer,"

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.400
which if you ask me, is...

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:55.801
-Far worse than Watergate,
quite frankly.

00:10:55.801 --> 00:10:58.033
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:58.033 --> 00:11:01.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:01.834 --> 00:11:02.767
God's Love We Deliver

00:11:02.767 --> 00:11:04.634
cooks and brings
over 2 million meals a year

00:11:04.634 --> 00:11:07.400
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS, cancer,

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.968
and other serious illnesses,

00:11:08.968 --> 00:11:10.400
and they need your help now
more than ever.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.000
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.634
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

